NAME
     cut - select columns from each line

SYNOPSIS
     cut -f LIST [-d DELIM] [-s] [FILE...]
     cut -c LIST [FILE...]

DESCRIPTION
     cut writes part of each line: fields chosen by -f, or characters
     chosen by -c. LIST is numbers and ranges, as in 1,3-5 or -3 or 2-.

OPTIONS
     -f LIST    these fields
     -c LIST    these character positions
     -d DELIM   the field separator (a tab by default)
     -s         leave out lines with no delimiter in them

SEE ALSO
     paste(1), awk(1), sed(1)
